# Source-derived semantics

- The outer and inner boxes are each 3 CSS inches (288 CSS px) with no-repeat backgrounds.
- The outer PNG contains a 96px red center-left oracle; the inner blue 96px image must cover it when `background-position: 0` is parsed as unitless zero.
- The visible assertion is “no red”; unsigned unitless zero is the baseline for cases 109 and 111.

# Compatibility adjustments

- Source setup-only `3in` dimensions use `1in = 96px`, yielding 288px. The tested `0` token is preserved verbatim.
- Broad `div` / `div div` selectors map to `.background-box` / `.test-image` so generated wrappers are not styled.
- Web content-box sizing, the 8px horizontal body inset, one-em paragraph spacing, normal wrapping, source child order, and bold “no red” emphasis are explicit.
- Card-local PNGs are byte-identical to the pinned source assets.
